---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Anping Wire Mesh: China's Wire Mesh Manufacturing Hub";
const description = "Anping County produces 80% of China's wire mesh. Learn about its industrial clusters, product specializations, quality tiers, and how to source effectively.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Hero with Stats -->
  <section class="bg-theme-secondary border-b border-theme py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">INDUSTRY CLUSTER PROFILE</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-theme-primary">Anping Wire Mesh</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-theme-secondary max-w-2xl mb-2">
        Anping County in Hebei Province produces an estimated 80% of China's wire mesh.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-theme-muted mb-8">
        China's wire mesh look to Anping — a single thread woven into a $12 billion industry.
      </p>

      <!-- Key Stats Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">15,000+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">Registered Enterprises</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">Across Anping County</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">$12B+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">Annual Output Value</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">2025 Estimate</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">60%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">Export Ratio</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">60+ Countries</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">500<span class="text-lg">yrs</span></p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">Industry Heritage</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">Since Ming Dynasty</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-theme-muted">
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-theme-accent">Home</a> / Anping Wire Mesh
  </nav>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0">
    <!-- Overview -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Why Anping Dominates Wire Mesh</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Anping's wire mesh industry dates to the Ming Dynasty, when local craftsmen wove silk
        for military use. Modern industrial production began in the 1950s and expanded
        dramatically after China's reform era. Today the county hosts thousands of registered
        wire mesh manufacturers, ranging from small workshops to large export-oriented factories.
      </p>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        The concentration creates several advantages for buyers:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">Complete supply chain</strong> — Wire drawing, weaving, welding, galvanizing, and PVC coating all happen locally</li>
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">Competitive pricing</strong> — Intense local competition keeps margins thin</li>
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">Product variety</strong> — From 5-micron filter mesh to heavy mining screens</li>
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">Export infrastructure</strong> — Many factories have 10+ years of export experience</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Industrial Zones -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Key Industrial Zones</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Anping's wire mesh production is concentrated in several townships, each with
        different specializations:
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Area</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Specialization</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Factory Type</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Anping Town (county seat)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Woven wire mesh, filter mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Medium to large manufacturers</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Taocheng Township</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Welded wire mesh, fence panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Mixed sizes, export-focused</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Hebin Township</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Galvanized wire, barbed wire</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Wire drawing specialists</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Mazhuang Township</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Gabion baskets, hexagonal mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Heavy mesh fabricators</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Industrial Development Zone</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">High-end stainless steel mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Larger, certified factories</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Product Specialization Map -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Product Specializations</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Different areas of Anping excel at different products. Matching your needs to the
        right specialization improves quality and pricing:
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Woven Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Traditional strength. Factories here produce everything from coarse 2-mesh
            screens to ultra-fine 500-mesh filter cloth. Stainless steel and brass are
            common materials.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Welded Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Post-weld galvanizing and PVC coating lines are concentrated in specific
            workshops. Quality varies significantly—visit or audit before large orders.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Fence Systems</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Complete production chains for 3D fence panels, chain link, and palisade fences.
            Accessories (posts, clamps, gates) often sourced from adjacent workshops.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Gabions & Geotextiles</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Heavy hexagonal mesh weaving and gabion assembly. Some factories offer
            design assistance for retaining wall projects.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Quality Tiers -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Quality Tiers</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Anping factories cluster into distinct quality tiers. Knowing which tier you need
        prevents both overpaying and quality disasters:
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Tier</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Characteristics</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Best For</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">Workshop</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">5-20 workers, basic equipment, limited QC</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Simple products, price-sensitive orders</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">Small Factory</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20-50 workers, some automation, basic testing</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Standard products, small to medium volumes</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">Medium Factory</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50-200 workers, modern lines, full QC department</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Export orders, consistent quality requirements</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">Large Manufacturer</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200+ workers, ISO certification, R&D capability</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Technical products, long-term contracts, OEM</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
          <strong class="text-theme-primary">Practical note:</strong> Many trading companies in Anping present themselves
          as factories. They're not necessarily bad—good traders add value through QC and
          logistics—but know what you're paying for. Ask for factory registration documents
          and production line photos if direct factory pricing matters to you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sourcing Tips -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Sourcing from Anping: Practical Tips</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Visit during production</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            If possible, visit during (not before) production for your order. This shows
            actual capacity and QC processes. Many buyers schedule visits during
            wire drawing or weaving of their batch.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Specify tolerances explicitly</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            "Standard quality" means different things to different factories. Always specify
            wire diameter tolerance (±0.01mm for precision mesh, ±0.05mm for industrial),
            mesh count tolerance, and acceptable defect rates in writing.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Test before shipping</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            For critical applications, arrange third-party inspection (SGS, BV, or local
            inspectors). For repeat orders, consider keeping a reference sample from
            an approved batch for comparison.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Understand pricing factors</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Anping pricing is competitive but not uniform. Key variables: wire cost
            (fluctuates with steel prices), zinc coating thickness, weaving complexity,
            and order size. Our <a href="/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">weight calculator</a> helps
            you verify material costs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Pages -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Continue Exploring</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/wire-mesh-hebei/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Hebei Wire Mesh Overview</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">Anping in context of Hebei's broader wire mesh industry</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Stainless Steel Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">Technical specifications and sourcing guide</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/sourcing-guide/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Sourcing Guide</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">Step-by-step procurement process</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/factories/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Factory Directory</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">Browse verified manufacturers</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-theme-secondary border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-theme-primary">Need Help Sourcing from Anping?</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">Send your specifications. We'll connect you with suitable manufacturers.</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block accent-bg font-semibold px-6 py-2 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition" style="color: #07090c;">
        Send Inquiry
      </a>
    </section>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar: Cluster Card -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5 sticky top-24">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">CLUSTER CARD</p>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Industry Profile</h3>
        
        <dl class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-theme pb-2">
            <dt class="text-theme-muted">Origin</dt>
            <dd class="text-theme-primary font-medium">Ming Dynasty (1500s)</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-theme pb-2">
            <dt class="text-theme-muted">Core Region</dt>
            <dd class="text-theme-primary font-medium">Anping County, Hengshui</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-theme pb-2">
            <dt class="text-theme-muted">Main Products</dt>
            <dd class="text-theme-primary font-medium text-right">Stainless Mesh<br/>Fence<br/>Gabion<br/>Filter Mesh<br/>Steel Grating</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <dt class="text-theme-muted">Honor</dt>
            <dd class="text-theme-primary font-medium text-right">National-level<br/>Industrial Cluster</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-theme">
          <a href="/inquiry/" class="block text-center accent-bg font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition text-sm" style="color: #07090c;">
            Send Inquiry
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
